## Pipeline history
- G0: 2026-05-23 — drafted from du Plooy, Expert4x Multi-MA Course; mechanized the visual "knot" concept

## Implementation Notes for Codex (P1)
- Compute 6 SMAs each bar; find `ma_high = MathMax(sma4,MathMax(sma8,MathMax(sma12,MathMax(sma16,MathMax(sma20,sma24)))))` and `ma_low = MathMin(...)` — chain of MathMax/MathMin
- `knot_spread = ma_high - ma_low`; store history for KNOT_BARS check
- Knot trigger: `for(i=1; i<=KNOT_BARS; i++) { if(spread[i] > KNOT_PIPS*pip_size) return false; } return true;`
- On knot trigger: place BUYSTOP at `ma_high[1] + pip_offset`, SELLSTOP at `ma_low[1] - pip_offset`; track both order tickets
- OCO: on `OnTradeTransaction`, when one ticket fills, call `OrderDelete()` on the other ticket
- Trail: after 1:1 profit, move SL to SMA4 (long) or SMA24 (short) on each bar; update if new SMA value is more favorable
- P3 sweeps: MA periods (4-24 step 4 / 5-30 step 5 / 8-48 step 8), KNOT_PIPS (5/10/15/20), KNOT_BARS (2/3/5), TP ratio (1.5/2.0/3.0×risk)

